# Design scratch — the SOURCE of the identity, not the identity itself.
# logos/*.svg and logos/LOGOS.md ARE tracked: they are the shipped assets and
# their contract. What is excluded is the exploration that produced them —
# candidate boards, a Gemini render, a zip of options. Roughly 900KB of dead
# weight in a repo that is cloned on every Community Cloud deploy, and none of
# it is reachable from the running app.
assets/candidates/
*.zip

